      "text": "The current data processing pipeline involves a `Context Planner` that feeds fixed-size chunks of the transcript (e.g., 80 lines) to a `Segment Agent`. The `Segment Agent` then identifies semantic segments (discussion topics) within that chunk, from which `Idea Units` are subsequently extracted.",
      "completeness": "complete",
      "uncertainty_note": "Describes the established multi-stage processing pipeline: Context Planner -> Segment Agent -> Idea Units."
